<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef weak on light to moderate demand and offerings.  Select and Choice chuck and round cuts weak, while the rib and loin cuts steady to weak. Beef trimmings not established. -USDA</p>
